    }
  ],
  "explanation": "The pipeline begins with the Global Compensation Policy Builder drafting a comprehensive approach that balances cost-of-labor, fairness, and transparency law tensions. Next, the Strategic Policy Refiner improves the draft for legal coherence and practical implementation. The Integrated Compliance & Fairness Gate then conducts a full quality review; if it outputs 'retry', the pipeline loops back to the Strategic Policy Refiner for up to 3 iterations until the policy passes. Once passed, the International HR & Legal Expert adds jurisdiction-specific nuance and governance mechanisms. Finally, the Executive Policy Polisher performs a last quality check and formats the document into a clear, leadership-ready policy."
